Add_Dynamic_Module AI Appeal_Recast_BehaviorTree_AI
AI Debug 1
AI Use InstallSmoke Default
AI Event InstallSmoke PlayerSeen
AI Decide InstallSmoke
AI Think InstallSmoke
AI Release InstallSmoke

Add_Dynamic_Module Files Appeal_Standard_Files
Files Set_Paths .
Files Create_Directory Tests/Installed_Plugins_Data/source
Files Write_All Tests/Installed_Plugins_Data/source/files.txt FILES_INSTALL_PASSED
Files Read_All Tests/Installed_Plugins_Data/source/files.txt

Add_Dynamic_Module Package Appeal_Standard_Package
Package Set_Paths Tests/Installed_Plugins_Data
Package Create Smoke Tests/Installed_Plugins_Data/source Tests/Installed_Plugins_Data/packed
Package Extract Tests/Installed_Plugins_Data/packed/Smoke.apkg Tests/Installed_Plugins_Data/extracted

Add_Dynamic_Module Storage Appeal_SQLite_Storage
Storage Set_Paths Tests/Installed_Plugins_Data
Storage Open Smoke
Storage Set Install STORAGE_INSTALL_PASSED
Storage Get Install
Storage Close Smoke

Add_Dynamic_Module World Appeal_Standard_World
World Set_Paths Tests/Installed_Plugins_Data
World Create Smoke
World Use_Scene Smoke
World Create_Entity InstallSmoke
World Set InstallSmoke Status WORLD_INSTALL_PASSED
World Save Smoke
World Close_Scene Smoke
World Load Smoke
World Get InstallSmoke Status

Add_Dynamic_Module Physics Appeal_Box2D_Physics
Physics Debug 1
Physics Use InstallSmoke Default
Physics Set_Position InstallSmoke 1 2 3
Physics Update InstallSmoke
Physics Release InstallSmoke

Physics Add_Plugin Jolt Resources/Modules/Appeal_Module_Physics/Appeal_Jolt_Physics/Appeal_Jolt_Physics.dll
Physics Load_Plugin Jolt
Physics Use InstallSmoke Jolt
Physics Set_Position InstallSmoke 1 2 3
Physics Update InstallSmoke
Physics Release InstallSmoke
Done
